{"id":"msg_m_ex_trina_01","cat":"messenger","group":{"id":"room_trina","label":"Trina · Nikke"},"label":"1. Oh my goodness,","stage":null,"prev":null,"next":"msg_m_ex_trina_02","speakers":{"trina":"Trina"},"icons":{"trina":"si_c412_00_s"},"lines":[{"id":"m_ex_trina_01_1","type":"Speech","speaker":"trina","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_trina_01_1","text":"Oh my goodness,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_trina_01_2","type":"Speech","speaker":"trina","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_trina_01_2","text":"Sun!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_trina_01_3","type":"Speech","speaker":"trina","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_trina_01_3","text":"Is that really you?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_trina_01_4","type":"Choice","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_trina_01_4","text":"The one and only.","jump":"m_ex_trina_01_6"},{"id":"m_ex_trina_01_5","type":"Choice","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_trina_01_5","text":"No, you must have me mistaken for someone else.","jump":"m_ex_trina_01_10"},{"id":"m_ex_trina_01_6","type":"Speech","speaker":"trina","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_trina_01_6","text":"I knew it!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_trina_01_7","type":"Speech","speaker":"trina","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_trina_01_7","text":"This is so wonderful!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_trina_01_8","type":"Speech","speaker":"trina","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_trina_01_8","text":"It feels like we've found a little space just for the two of us.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_trina_01_9","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_trina_01_9","text":"That's good to hear.","jump":"m_ex_trina_01_15"},{"id":"m_ex_trina_01_10","type":"Speech","speaker":"trina","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_trina_01_10","text":"Haha,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_trina_01_11","type":"Speech","speaker":"trina","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_trina_01_11","text":"don't be silly.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_trina_01_12","type":"Speech","speaker":"trina","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_trina_01_12","text":"You're too friendly to fool me.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_trina_01_13","type":"Speech","speaker":"trina","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_trina_01_13","text":"After all, you're Sun.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_trina_01_14","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_trina_01_14","text":"You caught me.","jump":"m_ex_trina_01_15"},{"id":"m_ex_trina_01_15","type":"Speech","speaker":"trina","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_trina_01_15","text":"Hehe.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_trina_01_16","type":"Speech","speaker":"trina","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_trina_01_16","text":"This may end up being a problem, actually. I should be focusing on my work.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_trina_01_17","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_trina_01_17","text":"Now that you mention it, what exactly is it that you do, Trina?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_trina_01_18","type":"Speech","speaker":"trina","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_trina_01_18","text":"What do I do?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_trina_01_19","type":"Speech","speaker":"trina","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_trina_01_19","text":"Well,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_trina_01_20","type":"Speech","speaker":"trina","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_trina_01_20","text":"I suppose if I were to put it simply,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_trina_01_21","type":"Speech","speaker":"trina","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_trina_01_21","text":"I'd say that","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_trina_01_22","type":"Speech","speaker":"trina","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_trina_01_22","text":"I take care of all the little ones who live in the Ark.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_trina_01_23","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_trina_01_23","text":"Little ones?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_trina_01_24","type":"Speech","speaker":"trina","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_trina_01_24","text":"That's right.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_trina_01_25","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_trina_01_25","text":"You have children?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_trina_01_26","type":"Speech","speaker":"trina","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_trina_01_26","text":"Haha,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_trina_01_27","type":"Speech","speaker":"trina","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_trina_01_27","text":"you could say that.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_trina_01_28","type":"Speech","speaker":"trina","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_trina_01_28","text":"I suppose you're curious as to what exactly I mean?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_trina_01_29","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_trina_01_29","text":"Indeed, I am. Tell me more.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_trina_01_30","type":"Speech","speaker":"trina","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_trina_01_30","text":"Well,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_trina_01_31","type":"Speech","speaker":"trina","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_trina_01_31","text":"the little ones may seem strong","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_trina_01_32","type":"Speech","speaker":"trina","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_trina_01_32","text":"and intimidating at first,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_trina_01_33","type":"Speech","speaker":"trina","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_trina_01_33","text":"but when you look closely,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_trina_01_34","type":"Speech","speaker":"trina","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_trina_01_34","text":"they can be positively adorable.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_trina_01_35","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_trina_01_35","text":"??","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_trina_01_36","type":"Speech","speaker":"trina","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_trina_01_36","text":"Some of them are small,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_trina_01_37","type":"Speech","speaker":"trina","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_trina_01_37","text":"and others are large.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_trina_01_38","type":"Speech","speaker":"trina","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_trina_01_38","text":"Oh!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_trina_01_39","type":"Speech","speaker":"trina","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_trina_01_39","text":"If you come visit my arboretum, you can see them.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_trina_01_40","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_trina_01_40","text":"Ah, I get it now.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_trina_01_41","type":"Speech","speaker":"trina","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_trina_01_41","text":"Haha.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_trina_01_42","type":"Speech","speaker":"trina","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_trina_01_42","text":"I take it you understand now?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_trina_01_43","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_trina_01_43","text":"Yes. You're referring to the trees.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_trina_01_44","type":"Speech","speaker":"trina","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_trina_01_44","text":"Hehe, that's right!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_trina_01_45","type":"Speech","speaker":"trina","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_trina_01_45","text":"Someday,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_trina_01_46","type":"Speech","speaker":"trina","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_trina_01_46","text":"I'll introduce you to them.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_trina_01_47","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_trina_01_47","text":"Sure, I'd like that.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_trina_01_48","type":"Speech","speaker":"trina","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_trina_01_48","text":"I'm not sure exactly when that day will be,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_trina_01_49","type":"Speech","speaker":"trina","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_trina_01_49","text":"but I hope that it's sometime soon.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_trina_01_50","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_trina_01_50","text":"I'm looking forward to it as well.","jump":null}],"chat":true}